+    /// turn's own `game::start_turn` is simulated here by setting `turn_
+    /// start_denoms` directly rather than driving the whole turn loop),
+    /// then Irrigation (denom 2) is developed mid-turn -- the real board
+    /// still has 2 tokens on Agriculture, not 1 consolidated token on
